Arch Rescue

Guided recovery: rescue-root
  - repair installed system
  - restore root from snapshot
  - reinstall OS preserving selected state

Wi-Fi connection instructions:
  1. Run: iwctl
  2. Run: device list
     Replace wlan0 below with your wireless device.
  3. Run: station wlan0 scan
  4. Run: station wlan0 get-networks
  5. Run: station wlan0 connect "Your Wi-Fi name"
     Enter the Wi-Fi password when prompted.
  6. Run: exit (to leave iwctl)
  7. Wait a few seconds, then run rescue-root again.
